  PAYROLL_ADMIN
  FINANCE
  AUDITOR
  SUPERVISOR
  EMPLOYEE
  /// A client's own approver and HR contact, who use the client portal and nothing else. Always need two-factor sign-in.
  CLIENT_APPROVER
  CLIENT_HR
  /// The bureau's sales person: the CRM, pipeline and proposals, and no payroll data.
  BUSINESS_DEV
  /// A company's own salesperson (the sales module only): sees and changes their own records.
  SALES_REP
  /// Sees and changes their own records and those of the people in the teams they manage; may be named a quote approver.
  SALES_MANAGER
  /// A salesperson who looks after client accounts: their own accounts and the cases, renewals and deals on them.
  ACCOUNT_MANAGER
}

